WEBVTT

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:32.007
No longer a child, but a young woman.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.643
High on my newfound maturity,

00:01:34.667 --> 00:01:39.027
I felt it was only natural to try drinking
rum for the first time that night, too.

00:01:39.496 --> 00:01:41.558
That was a bad idea.

00:01:41.582 --> 00:01:43.070
I became very ill,

00:01:43.094 --> 00:01:44.914
drifting in and out of consciousness

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:48.063
in between spasms of convulsive vomiting.

00:01:48.087 --> 00:01:51.051
The security guards wanted
to call me an ambulance,

00:01:51.075 --> 00:01:54.064
but Tom acted as my knight
in shining armor,

00:01:54.088 --> 00:01:56.123
and told them he'd take me home.

00:01:56.782 --> 00:01:58.483
It was like a fairy tale,

00:01:58.507 --> 00:02:00.283
his strong arms around me,